title: "neural-heston-calibration: C++20 COS+LM vs. Sobolev Neural Surrogates for Heston Calibration"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CarlosDsuarez/neural-heston-calibration"
authors:
