  - pytorch
  - sobolev-training
  - nanobind
abstract: >-
  A high-performance C++20/Python benchmark comparing an analytic-gradient
  Fourier-COS + Levenberg-Marquardt Heston calibration engine against Sobolev
  neural grid surrogates, pointwise random-grid surrogates, inverse warm-start
  ensembles, and a mandatory out-of-distribution circuit-breaker.
